WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.492
Open Manage hosting.

2
00:00:01.492 --> 00:00:05.239
The overview lists any domains that aren't connected yet.

3
00:00:05.289 --> 00:00:09.539
Click Connect next to the domain.

4
00:00:09.589 --> 00:00:10.804
Follow the steps.

5
00:00:10.804 --> 00:00:16.729
Either switch the nameservers, or add the A record and the www record shown.

6
00:00:16.779 --> 00:00:26.259
The helper checks again every 30 seconds, and ticks off each step as soon as it's live.
